  "You can use {p0}name{p1}, {p2}party{p3}, {p4}restaurant{p5}, {p6}date{p7}, {p8}time{p9} and {p10}code{p11}. Guests with an e-mail address get it automatically when e-mail is set up.": "Vous pouvez utiliser {p0}name{p1}, {p2}party{p3}, {p4}restaurant{p5}, {p6}date{p7}, {p8}time{p9} et {p10}code{p11}. Les clients ayant une adresse e-mail le reçoivent automatiquement lorsque l'e-mail est configuré.",
